WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
If you take a blood thinner medication, you may need to adjust your timing

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.040
before the procedure.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.960
Blood thinners can affect our ability to safely address anything we find during

4
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:09.920
your colonoscopy,

5
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.320
so getting the timing right matters. Please contact your doctor's office as

6
00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.440
soon as possible if you

7
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.760
haven't already discussed this with them. Do not stop or change your blood

8
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.000
thinner on your own.

9
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.610
They will give you specific instructions based on your medication and your

10
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.720
personal health history.

11
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:29.840
This is an important one, so please don't wait on it.
